    item('c15j', '15:00', 'activity', 'Afternoon, your call: rest at the hub, the Higashiyama temple walk, Takayama Jinya or the Hida Folk Village', location='All in town', status='idea', notes='The temple walk is a quiet 3.5 km loop above the town that starts near the hub and earns dinner. Jinya (¥440) is the only surviving Edo provincial office; the Folk Village (¥700) is a hillside of relocated farmhouses, 10 min by bus.'),
